  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      This is just where I write things down.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most pieces start when something small gets stuck in my head—a contradiction in daily life, an unexamined assumption, or a question that takes a bit of quiet to think through.
    </p>

    <p>
      No schedule, no manifesto. Just an open notebook.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>

    <p>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>, static HTML/CSS, and set in <em>IBM Plex Mono</em>. No tracking, ads, or cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      New essays go to <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
